Package: metawebr
Type: Package
Title: Build Fish Metawebs and Compute Local Food-Web Indices
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    "Virginie", "Marques",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "virginie.marques@usys.ethz.ch",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5142-4191")
  )
Description: Infers a regional fish food web (metaweb) from body size with an
    allometric niche model, corrects it with ecological rules based on FishBase
    traits, and computes network indices for local communities such as eDNA
    samples, optionally compared with null models.
